0..77 Comment "// A Tarski universe closed under dependent pairs and paths, with the decoder"
78..104 Comment "// arms that stay refused."
105..107 Comment "//"
108..186 Comment "// Martin-Löf\'s universe is closed under dependent functions, dependent pairs"
187..262 Comment "// and identity types. Each such code decodes to a family at the decodes of"
263..322 Comment "// its fields. A decode thus stands as a family\'s argument."
323..325 Comment "//"
326..401 Comment "// Each code is its own block. One refusal thus leaves the others standing."
402..476 Comment "// A run binds a decode as a type of its own. A field at the code\'s decode"
477..553 Comment "// then stands apart from it. The fragment check refuses a path\'s carrier as"
554..583 Comment "// a marked call by its sort."
584..586 Comment "//"
587..661 Comment "// - see: #3681 — a marked call as a path\'s carrier, refused by its sort"
662..738 Comment "// - see: `model/universe/pair-and-path-codes.gandr` — the pair codes with"
739..776 Comment "//   their decodes in place, admitted"
777..847 Comment "// - see: Martin-Löf, _Intuitionistic Type Theory_, Bibliopolis, 1984"
849..865 Comment "// The naturals."
866..872 Keyword "import"
873..874 StringLit "\""
